// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// MODULE: Index, Public API surface
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// @public, Only export what external consumers (runtime/cli/, other packages) need.
// Internal runtime code should import from lib/ directly, not through this barrel.
